                                                "sense_id": "d765b806-3389-3ab9-a190-21f144cc206c",
                                                "text": "California poll support for Jerry Brown's tax increases has ominous implications for U.S. taxpayers too Los Angeles Times Headline April 25, 2011"
                                            },
